A command whose unexported broken holds a type error and carries a record naming
DS1001, the code of an unused exported declaration. No finding about broken can
carry DS1001 whatever the type error hides, so the record is stale.

-- go.mod --
module example.com/app

go 1.27
-- deadset.json --
{"target": {"kind": "application"}}
-- main.go --
package main

func main() {}

//deadset:ignore DS1001 -- kept for the loader
func broken() int { return undefinedName }
